  "cues": [
    {
      "s": 0.12,
      "e": 4.237,
      "text": "ACR stands for Arc Compute Rate. It publishes reference"
    },
    {
      "s": 4.1370000000000005,
      "e": 9.438,
      "text": "indices for AI inference, GPU compute, and data delivery,"
    },
    {
      "s": 9.338,
      "e": 11.644,
      "text": "with updates recorded on-chain."
    },
    {
      "s": 11.52,
      "e": 15.324000000000002,
      "text": "It also helps businesses investigate compute bills, comparing"
    },
    {
      "s": 15.224,
      "e": 18.389,
      "text": "charges with published market prices. Those price comparisons"
    },
    {
      "s": 18.289,
      "e": 21.79,
      "text": "are separate from ACR\u2019s reference indices."
    },
    {
      "s": 21.653333333333332,
      "e": 25.01533333333333,
      "text": "Aomi brings those tools into the conversation. Let\u2019s"
    },
    {
      "s": 24.915333333333333,
      "e": 28.59133333333333,
      "text": "check this bill and inspect the evidence. The agent flags"
    },
    {
      "s": 28.49133333333333,
      "e": 32.08633333333333,
      "text": "it for review and explains that the pricing data is nearly"
    },
    {
      "s": 31.98633333333333,
      "e": 36.68333333333333,
      "text": "thirteen days old. That context matters before considering"
    },
    {
      "s": 36.58333333333333,
      "e": 37.58933333333333,
      "text": "a payment."
    },
    {
      "s": 37.453333333333326,
      "e": 40.82733333333333,
      "text": "The treasury implementation connects that review to on-chain"
    },
    {
      "s": 40.72733333333333,
      "e": 44.42633333333333,
      "text": "payments. Aomi provides cloud-hosted contract access"
    },
    {
      "s": 44.32633333333333,
      "e": 48.04833333333333,
      "text": "alongside the app\u2019s API tools. A configured deployment"
    },
    {
      "s": 47.94833333333332,
      "e": 51.19533333333333,
      "text": "checks ownership, funds, budget, and replay protection"
    },
    {
      "s": 51.09533333333333,
      "e": 53.06433333333333,
      "text": "before preparing a payment."
    },
    {
      "s": 52.919999999999995,
      "e": 56.875,
      "text": "Here is the actual workflow on GitHub: stage the transaction,"
    },
    {
      "s": 56.775,
      "e": 60.532,
      "text": "simulate it, and ask the owner to authorize it. After"
    },
    {
      "s": 60.431999999999995,
      "e": 63.655,
      "text": "confirmation, verify the receipt and payment event before"
    },
    {
      "s": 63.55499999999999,
      "e": 66.99799999999999,
      "text": "updating the bill. This is implemented code; deployed"
    },
    {
      "s": 66.898,
      "e": 69.274,
      "text": "payment acceptance is still pending."
    },
    {
      "s": 69.18666666666667,
      "e": 73.25766666666667,
      "text": "A general-purpose agent framework can call tools. Aomi"
    },
    {
      "s": 73.15766666666666,
      "e": 76.93766666666666,
      "text": "also supplies contract access and the transaction pipeline,"
    },
    {
      "s": 76.83766666666666,
      "e": 79.93266666666666,
      "text": "so the protocol team can focus on its business rules"
    },
    {
      "s": 79.83266666666667,
      "e": 84.19366666666666,
      "text": "instead of assembling the blockchain execution infrastructure."
    },
    {
      "s": 83.72,
      "e": 87.431,
      "text": "ACR registers its tools and treasury skill here. The"
    },
    {
      "s": 87.33099999999999,
      "e": 91.03,
      "text": "frontend imports Aomi\u2019s widget and points it at the app."
    },
    {
      "s": 90.92999999999999,
      "e": 94.339,
      "text": "That connects the protocol\u2019s workflow to the conversation"
    },
    {
      "s": 94.23899999999999,
      "e": 96.405,
      "text": "inside its existing interface."
    },
    {
      "s": 96.25333333333333,
      "e": 98.72133333333332,
      "text": "ACR, powered by Aomi."
    }
  ],
